WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:04,570
Your Majesty

2
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:05,900
Fangyang, the son of Duke Bi

3
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:07,540
Create a Cao Yun alliance

4
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:09,020
Control the capital Cao Yun

5
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:10,860
Oppressing the people and committing all kinds of evil

6
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:13,060
I ask your Majesty to take charge of this son.

7
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:18,100
The public of Your Majesty's country is running to protect the country

8
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:20,500
His son Fangyang is still young

9
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:23,500
Controlling Cao Yun is empty talk

10
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:25,340
Let this be settled

11
00:00:25,340 --> 00:00:27,780
I want to mention your Majesty again.

12
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:29,860
This matter concerns the people of the capital

13
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:32,260
Your Majesty, please think twice

14
00:00:32,260 --> 00:00:34,410
Cao Yun's incident

15
00:00:34,410 --> 00:00:36,130
I have already paid a private visit

16
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:38,400
How exactly?

17
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:40,420
I know better than you

18
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:46,180
Don't bring this matter up again, Your Majesty.

19
00:00:46,180 --> 00:00:48,820
Your Majesty is dedicated to traveling abroad for the sake of the country.

20
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:51,020
His son Fangyang has a bad character

21
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:53,140
Everyone in the capital knows

22
00:00:53,140 --> 00:00:54,060
I think

23
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:57,260
Both fish and fish should be punished
